# The script demo's game script (Phase 27 Day 475), minted by the build: `asset_mint mint-script` writes the blob the demo loads
# and, with --dev-out, the editable copy `5c27de0000000475.lua` the demo watches for hot reload. The id is `kDemoScriptId`
# (demo_world.h).
id 5c27de0000000475
lua demo.lua
